# kw-hom-bcs-prefix: Is hom, a prefix of hom_bcs, an ignored line like hom_bcs itself (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: 5
# pc: ODE0019
# ruling: XPPAUT ignores a line whose first word it does not know (kw-unknown-word), and hom_bcs is not a statement in 8.2.2.
x'=0
x(0)=3
par a=5
aux v=a
hom 1
@ total=0,dt=1
